        "original_id": "69e86145-8069-5749-94a4-7cf7c3b2edb9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Garrett Morris, Jamie Foxx, Garcelle Beauvais, Christopher B. Duncan, Ellia English, Judyann Elder, Tisha Campbell\n- TV Shows: Saturday Night Live, Martin, The Jamie Foxx Show\n- Roles: Stan Winters, Nadine Waters, Gina\n\nFacts:\n- Garrett Morris was born on February 1, 1937, and is an American comedian and actor.\n- Garrett Morris was part of the original cast of Saturday Night Live and appeared on the program from 1975 to 1980.\n- Martin is an American sitcom that aired on Fox for five seasons from August 27, 1992 to May 1, 1997.\n- Garrett Morris played Stan Winters on the sitcom Martin from 1992 to 1995.\n- Judyann Elder was known for playing Nadine Waters, who was Gina's mother, on the Fox sitcom Martin.\n- Tisha Campbell portrayed Gina on the Fox sitcom Martin.\n- The Jamie Foxx Show starred Jamie Foxx, Garcelle Beauvais, Christopher B. Duncan, Ellia English, and Garrett Morris.",
